# Kubernetes Architecture Flow

```text
+====================================================+
|              CONTROL PLANE (MASTER NODE)           |
+====================================================+

     User / kubectl
            |
            v
 +---------------------+
 |   kube-apiserver    |
 +---------------------+
       |         |
       |         |
       v         v
 +-----------+  +------------------+
 |   etcd    |  | kube-scheduler   |
 +-----------+  +------------------+
                      |
                      |
                      v

======================================================
              WORKER NODE
======================================================

             +------------+
             |  kubelet   |
             +------------+
                    |
                    v
         +----------------------+
         | Container Runtime    |
         | (containerd/CRI-O)   |
         +----------------------+
                    |
                    v
             +------------+
             |    Pods    |
             +------------+
                    ^
                    |
             +------------+
             | kube-proxy |
             +------------+
```

