# Quick Summary

### Master Node Components
- kube-apiserver → Communication Hub
- etcd → Cluster Database
- kube-scheduler → Pod Placement Decision Maker
- kube-controller-manager → State Maintenance
- cloud-controller-manager → Cloud Integrations

### Worker Node Components
- kubelet → Node Agent
- kube-proxy → Networking Component
- Container Runtime → Container Execution Engine
- Pods → Application Workloads
